@startuml EventFlow
title Event Flow Architecture (project-specific "C5" view) — Canonical Event Catalog v1.0, correction loop
left to right direction

rectangle "Contestation" as C
rectangle "Adjudication" as A
rectangle "Election/Lifecycle" as E
rectangle "Audit" as AU
queue "outbox_events\n→ Relay (registry)\n→ inbox_events" as BUS

C --> BUS : ChallengeRaised v1
C --> BUS : ChallengeAdmitted / Dismissed v1
C --> BUS : ChallengeRouted v1
C --> BUS : ChallengeAdjudicated v1
C --> BUS : ChallengeResolved v1
A --> BUS : DeterminationIssued v1 (Core)
E --> BUS : ElectionCorrectionApplied v1 (Core)

BUS --> A : ChallengeRouted
BUS --> C : DeterminationIssued
BUS --> E : DeterminationIssued (Upheld only acts)
BUS --> C : ElectionCorrectionApplied
BUS --> AU : ALL events

note bottom of BUS
  Envelope (8 fields): EventId · EventType · AggregateId · AggregateVersion
  · OccurredAt · CorrelationId · CausationId · SchemaVersion
  Single producer per event (AT-EVT-001) · additive change → SchemaVersion+1;
  breaking → new event name (ADR-T5) · hydrators support vCurrent + vPrevious ONLY
end note
note bottom
  NOT shown, by rule: Voting never consumes DeterminationIssued.
  No payload anywhere carries voter↔vote linkage (CI-5 / Q7 / ADR-T11).
end note
@enduml
